# Io: Io Programming Guide (iolanguage.org); requirements/languages/io.md
name     io
keyword  method block if then else while for loop return break continue clone do self call
builtin  true false nil Object Lobby writeln println
line-comment   // #
block-comment  /* */
string   """ """  : multiline
string   " "      : escapes
operators  +-*/%&|^!<>=:?~.
upper-type
